  "title": "Easy Blackberry Cobbler",
  "description": "This blackberry cobbler recipe uses fresh blackberries and makes a buttery biscuit topping with pantry ingredients for a fabulous summer dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Johnson-Lindsey"
  ],
